  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul class=\"marker:text-textOff list-disc\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"my-0\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Positive inv(16):</strong>&nbsp;The presence of inv(16)(p13q22) or CBFB-MYH11 fusion transcript confirms diagnosis of AML M4Eo subtype. This genetic abnormality is associated with favorable prognosis with appropriate treatment.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\">\n<p class=\"my-0\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Negative inv(16):</strong>&nbsp;No evidence of inv(16) detected. AML subtype or prognosis should be evaluated with other markers and clinical findings.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
